      "statement": "B-2016-04 is superseded by B-2021-08 for policies effective on or after 2021-08-19 but remains in force for policies written under it; separately, HO 01 45 (2019-01) remains in force for policies written under it despite supersession by the 2022-01 edition for policies effective on or after 2022-01-01.",
