    {
      "id": "claim_c229b37b90034198bf26cb681d9d249c",
      "statement": "The deductible caps and floors in the Texas wind bulletins are regulatory parameters, not authorization to overwrite the issued contract: B-2016-04 establishes a 1% wind/hail minimum and 3% hurricane cap, while B-2021-08 establishes a 1% named-storm minimum, 5% hurricane cap, and 10% seacoast windstorm cap.",
