      "id": "claim_d0bf78b0f17e445498ffca53824fbd16",
      "statement": "For an attached 2022 HO 01 45 amendment, the declared Windstorm and Hail Deductible applies only to covered direct physical windstorm-or-hail loss, separately and before payment, is calculated using the applicable loss-date property limit, and applies to Coverage A plus only other coverages identified in the Declarations; its T.6.4 seacoast maximum of 10% implements B-2021-08's 10% seacoast windstorm cap.",
