      "id": "claim_1b23632aafa04145981516e41e8af83f",
      "statement": "The attached 2019 HO 01 45 amendment has materially different wind/hail terms: it uses a 1%–5% percentage and expressly reaches building property, personal property, loss of use, debris removal, and reasonable emergency measures; it applies the deductible after determining covered loss and once as required for the same occurrence.",
