    {
      "id": "claim_6c0053c58dfd4588b055489eed747847",
      "statement": "HO 01 45 (2022-01) T.3.4 implements B-2021-08 B.3.22: the Named Storm Period begins with an official governmental-weather-authority designation and continues for 72 hours after it ends; the period and a storm designation do not create coverage or establish causation, which must be determined from loss facts.",
