      "statement": "A Texas windstorm-deductible increase is prospective and edition sensitive: 2019 HO 01 45 T.2.2 implements B-2016-04's 30-day notice requirement, whereas the attached 2022 amendment requires 45 days even though B-2021-08 requires at least 30 days; the applicable deductible is determined by the loss date rather than report or payment date.",
