      "id": "claim_35ac3451e67b44b08e7762a8d2f23904",
      "statement": "Both HO 01 45 editions require at least 10 days' notice for cancellation for nonpayment and 30 days for other cancellation, but their nonrenewal notice periods differ—30 days in 2019 and 45 days in 2022—and the 2022 amendment preserves claims for pre-termination loss.",
