      "id": "claim_353871100fdd4d8a989937271c5f3b25",
      "statement": "Texas wind/hail claim records must support the applicable deductible with claim-specific causation, inspection, estimate, communications, and payment information; B-2021-08 requires explanation of the policy provision and distinguishes no payment within a deductible from a coverage denial, while B-2019-02 requires reviewable retention of material communications, requests, decisions, and payments.",
